      "comment": "Rahman: The Village Keepers and the Mysterious Ruins",
      "content": "Rahman's gang took Aaru Village's missing Village Keepers from Akademiya agents. In the exchange he produces only Khalil; Dehya attacks, an earthquake drops everyone into ruins from King Deshret's era, and a recording by the priest Kasala explains how Rukkhadevata and Deshret suppressed forbidden knowledge. Rahman apologises and hands over the researchers Judar and Morghi.",
