      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Rahman: The Irminsul crisis diversion",
      "content": "In Truth Amongst the Pages of Purana (Act X), Cyno, Dehya, Candace, Jeht, Rahman and Rana fight their way into Sumeru City as a distraction while Tighnari, Wanderer, Paimon and the Traveler climb the Divine Tree to the Sanctuary of Surasthana. They meet Pantalone's decoy, which Cyno recognises as fake.",
